     3,
     "<div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">Hello everybody,<div><br></div><div>Sorry to have to email for this detail, but I am new to ggplot2 and I am trying to understand what I am doing wrong. I am trying to change the axes labels and I get an error message: &quot;Error in unit(at, &quot;native&quot;) : &#39;x&#39; and &#39;units&#39; must have length &gt; 0&quot;</div>\n\n\n\n<div><br></div><div>If someone can help me and explain what in the code is wrong and what the message means, I will truly appreciate it. I am trying to plot a species number sample accumulation curve.<br clear=\"all\"><div>\n\n\n\n<br></div><div><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco;color:#971f16\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Ecadults</span><span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">&lt;-read.table(</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">file</span><span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">=</span>&quot;/Users/paolabarriga/Desktop/EstimateSECadults.txt&quot;<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000000\"> header</span><span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">=</span><span style=\"color:#b6882c\">T</span><span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000000\"> sep</span><span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">=</span>&quot;\\t&quot;<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">)</span></p>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco\"><span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">names(</span>Ecadults<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">)</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco\"><span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">str(</span>Ecadults<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">)</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco\">Ecadults<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">$</span>group</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco\">Ecadults<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">$</span>samples</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco\">Ecadults<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">$</span>data</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco\">Ecadults<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">$</span>lower</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco\">Ecadults<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">$</span>upper</p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco\">\n</p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco\">Ec<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">&lt;-ggplot(</span>data<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">=</span>Ecadults<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">,</span> <span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">aes(</span>x<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">=</span>samples<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">,</span> y<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">=</span>data<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">,</span> group<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">=</span>group<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">,</span> colour<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">=</span>group<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">))+geom_line()+geom_point()+geom_errorbar(aes(</span>ymin<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">=</span>data<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">-</span>lower<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">,</span>ymax<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">=</span>data<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">+</span>upper<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">),</span> width<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">=</span><span style=\"color:#265020\">0.01</span><span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">)</span></p>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco;color:#0a1d90\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Ec</span>+scale_x_discrete(<span style=\"color:#971f16\">&quot;sample number&quot;</span>)<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span>+<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span>scale_y_discrete(<span style=\"color:#971f16\">&quot;species number&quot;</span>)</p>\n\n\n\n<p></p></div><div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div><div><br></div><div>Paola</div>-- <br><span style=\"font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;,&#39;new york&#39;,times,serif;font-size:16px\"><div>Paola A. Barriga<br>Ph.D. Candidate<br>\n\n\n\nDepart